<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vilona Trade FX</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: #0a0a0f;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 480px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4ff, #7b2ff7);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .subtitle {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .bot-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e);
            border: 1px solid #2a2a4e;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px 28px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .bot-link:hover {
            border-color: #00d4ff;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.1);
        }
        .bot-avatar {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4ff, #7b2ff7);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .bot-info {
            text-align: left;
        }
        .bot-name {
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .bot-handle {
            color: #00d4ff;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4ff, #7b2ff7);
            color: #fff;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.2);
        }
        .btn-secondary {
            background: #1a1a2e;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a4e;
            color: #e0e0e0;
        }
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            border-color: #00d4ff;
        }
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .feature {
            background: #111;
            border: 1px solid #1a1a2e;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 12px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .feature-icon { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .feature-label { color: #888; font-size: 11px; }
        .status {
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #555;
        }
        .status-dot {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #00ff88;
            margin-right: 6px;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        .share-section {
            margin-top: 32px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.05), rgba(123, 47, 247, 0.05));
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.15);
            border-radius: 16px;
        }
        .share-section p {
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .share-link {
            display: inline-block;
            color: #00d4ff;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        .share-link:hover {
            background: rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.1);
            border-color: #00d4ff;
        }
        @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.4; } }
        @media (max-width: 400px) {
            .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">🤖</div>
        <h1>Vilona Trade FX</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">AI-Powered Trading Assistant</p>

        <a href="https://t.me/berkahkaryaforexbotbot" class="bot-link" target="_blank">
            <div class="bot-avatar">⚡</div>
            <div class="bot-info">
                <div class="bot-name">Vilona AI Bot</div>
                <div class="bot-handle">@berkahkaryaforexbotbot</div>
            </div>
        </a>

        <div class="btn-group">
            <a href="https://t.me/berkahkaryaforexbotbot" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank">
                💬 Mulai Bot Sekarang
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
                <div>AI Market Analysis</div>
                <div class="feature-label">4 model AI ensemble</div>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔔</div>
                <div>Real-time Signals</div>
                <div class="feature-label">XAUUSD, BTC, EUR, GBP, OIL</div>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
                <div>Auto-Trade EA</div>
                <div class="feature-label">Smart Layering &trade;</div>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">💚</div>
                <div>Gotong Royong</div>
                <div class="feature-label">Dukung Server AI</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="status">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            Server AI Online
        </div>

        <div class="share-section">
            <p>Bantu share ke temen-temen kamu ya!<br>Semoga bermanfaat buat kita semua 🙏</p>
            <a href="https://phantomfx.aitradepulse.com" class="share-link" target="_blank">
                🔗 phantomfx.aitradepulse.com
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
